## AI Cheat Sheet - important Commands:

1) Qdrant - Docker container:

    Start Stop container and database(Database ID Required): 
    - "docker start f8262d91d83e"
    - "docker stop f8262d91d83e"

    The Senior Developer Shortcut (No IDs Required):
        Instead of looking up the random container ID every time, you can use these smart one-liners. 
        They automatically find your Qdrant container and cycle its power status:
    - Start Qdrant instantly: "docker start $(docker ps -a -q --filter ancestor=qdrant/qdrant)"
    - Stop Qdrant instantly: "docker stop $(docker ps -q --filter ancestor=qdrant/qdrant)"

2) Python Virtual Environment (venv):

    - To activate: "source venv/bin/activate"
    - To deactivate: "deactivate"

